==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~33.33 seconds<sup>200f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[7th Anniversary Birthday Cake]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
The [[7th Anniversary Birthday Cake]] seems to be a tough opponent, but spamming quick units such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] can get the stage beaten easily. Bringing [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] or other [[Critical Hit|critical hitters]] can finish the stage faster.

